cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the dataset, please cite them as below."
title: "HidroXAI-MX: reproducible pipeline for the Hidro-MX hydroclimatic dataset"
abstract: >-
  Library and reproducible pipeline that downloads, curates, validates and versions
  open hydroclimatic data for Mexican pilot basins (CONAGUA-SIH daily series and
  INEGI CEM 3.0) and builds the Hidro-MX dataset deposited on Zenodo.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Sánchez Ruiz"
    given-names: "Daniel"
    affiliation: "Unidad Profesional Interdisciplinaria de Ingeniería campus Tlaxcala (UPIIT), Instituto Politécnico Nacional (IPN)"
version: "2026.10"
date-released: "2026-10-04"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/pantrok/hidroxai-mx"
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: "10.5281/zenodo.21231600"
    description: "Concept DOI of the Hidro-MX dataset on Zenodo (resolves to the latest snapshot; CC BY 4.0)."
  - type: doi
    value: "10.5281/zenodo.23150556"
    description: "Zenodo deposit of the Hidro-MX v2026.10 dataset snapshot (data and code)."
  - type: doi
    value: "10.5281/zenodo.21231601"
    description: "Zenodo deposit of the Hidro-MX v2026.06 dataset snapshot."
keywords:
  - hydrology
  - streamflow
  - precipitation
  - open data
  - reproducibility
  - Mexico
  - CONAGUA
  - INEGI
notes: >-
  Project IND-2026-0335, Instituto Politécnico Nacional (IPN), 2026 Call for
  Scientific Research and Technological Development Projects (PICDT 2026).
  The curated dataset is deposited on Zenodo under CC BY 4.0.
